    {
      "component_id": "c_012",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Recipe Keeper is the easy way to keep all your favorite recipes organized in one place. We've added a few sample recipes to get you started but you can delete these at any time. The free version of Recipe Keeper allows you to store up to 20 recipes. Upgrade to Recipe Keeper Pro to store an unlimited number of recipes and to sync your recipes, shopping lists and meal planner across all your Android devices. Recipe Keeper is also available on Windows 8, Windows 10, iPhone, iPad and Windows Phone. We hope you enjoy using Recipe Keeper!",
